"Inspection~2 View at pid: ~1%s~3, running ~1%s~3.  Locating: ~1%s~6\n"
"Use~2:  left/right/up/down/etc to ~1navigate~5 the output; 'L'/'&' to "
"~1locate~5/~1next~5.\n"
"Or~2:   <Enter> to ~1select another~5; 'q' or <Esc> to ~1end~5 !\n"
